01:11:21,360 --> 01:11:22,360
Right.

237
01:11:22,360 --> 01:11:32,360
That if the school goes and comes up with an arbitrary, ridiculous list of requirements, you don't sit there saying, this is an arbitrary, ridiculous list of requirements and I'm not going to go along with it.

