01:11:32,360 --> 01:11:39,360
In that case, you don't get to graduate and your employers will not want to hire you because you would not signal your conformity.

239
01:11:39,360 --> 01:11:43,360
On the other hand, like a good student just says, what are the requirements again?

240
01:11:43,360 --> 01:11:44,360
All right, great.

