Nope.

248
01:11:54,360 --> 01:11:55,360
All right, great.

249
01:11:55,360 --> 01:11:56,360
All right, let's do that.

250
01:11:56,360 --> 01:11:58,360
Or again, it might be, like, do they care what it is?

251
01:11:58,360 --> 01:12:00,360
All right, well, what's the hardest one?

252
01:12:00,360 --> 01:12:03,360
So, not the, you might say, well, Latin's harder.

