01:12:05,360 --> 01:12:07,360
But you're never going to use Latin on a job.

255
01:12:07,360 --> 01:12:10,360
But it might impress employers more in their more useful language, actually.

256
01:12:10,360 --> 01:12:12,360
So, it might be that.

257
01:12:12,360 --> 01:12:13,360
Right.

258
01:12:13,360 --> 01:12:16,360
So, I actually have a story about why this last one is better.

259
01:12:16,360 --> 01:12:20,360
Why signaling conformity is especially crucial is here's the thing.

