01:12:44,360 --> 01:12:48,360
And yet there's a lot of jobs where you suspect you wouldn't even get an interview based upon that.

267
01:12:48,360 --> 01:12:53,360
And it's like, yeah, well, sure you're smart and hardworking, but you just don't want to submit to social expectations.

268
01:12:53,360 --> 01:12:57,360
Because in our society, you're supposed to go and complete a bunch of degrees.

269
01:12:57,360 --> 01:12:58,360
And you didn't do that.

