01:12:59,360 --> 01:13:03,360
If you're that smart and that hardworking, it should have been easy for you to get a college degree.

272
01:13:03,360 --> 01:13:04,360
But you didn't.

273
01:13:04,360 --> 01:13:05,360
Why not?

274
01:13:05,360 --> 01:13:08,360
Why not, indeed?

275
01:13:08,360 --> 01:13:11,360
And, again, a natural inference is you've got some problem with authority.

276
01:13:11,360 --> 01:13:12,360
You won't fit in.

277
01:13:12,360 --> 01:13:14,360
You won't go along.

278
01:13:14,360 --> 01:13:18,360
And, again, for virtually every job, conformity is important.

279
01:13:18,360 --> 01:13:21,360
Even jobs that people say, well, you have to be really creative here.

280
01:13:21,360 --> 01:13:22,360
We don't want a bunch of conformists.

281
01:13:22,360 --> 01:13:28,360
Well, you want someone who is creative within the confines of the job.

