01:13:35,360 --> 01:13:39,360
And we should go and come up with a totally different product and find totally different customers.

287
01:13:39,360 --> 01:13:41,360
That's my plan.

288
01:13:41,360 --> 01:13:46,360
People like this are unwelcome on virtually every job on earth.

289
01:13:46,360 --> 01:13:48,360
And I know some people like this.

290
01:13:48,360 --> 01:13:49,360
They're very lovable and fun people.

291
01:13:49,360 --> 01:13:52,360
But I don't want to employ them.

292
01:13:52,360 --> 01:13:53,360
Not at all.

293
01:13:53,360 --> 01:13:56,360
So, let's get the calls here.

294
01:13:56,360 --> 01:14:01,360
So, this is my general story about why this non-job-related school is the race to your income.

295
01:14:01,360 --> 01:14:02,360
You can go through the other ones.

296
01:14:02,360 --> 01:14:05,360
So, obviously, with the warranty.

297
01:14:05,360 --> 01:14:13,360
So, when a firm goes and slaps a really good warranty on a product, it does not improve the product when you slap the warranty on.

298
01:14:13,360 --> 01:14:15,360
But here's the thing.

299
01:14:15,360 --> 01:14:16,360
Suppose your product is awesome.

300
01:14:16,360 --> 01:14:21,360
How much does it cost you to offer an awesome warranty?

301
01:14:21,360 --> 01:14:22,360
Next to nothing, right?

302
01:14:22,360 --> 01:14:24,360
Who's going to go and return your awesome product?

303
01:14:24,360 --> 01:14:30,360
If you know everyone who buys it loves it, you can go and offer a fantastic warranty, and it costs you next to nothing.

304
01:14:30,360 --> 01:14:36,360
On the other hand, if your product is junk, then it's very costly to offer a warranty because a lot of people are going to want their money back.

305
01:14:36,360 --> 01:14:41,360
So, it is a very credible signal of quality to give a great warranty.

306
01:14:41,360 --> 01:14:44,360
Or, again, the nice paper.

307
01:14:44,360 --> 01:14:53,360
So, if there are some people who are willing to go and make a special trip to the store and spend some extra money to go and impress you, and others aren't,

308
01:14:53,360 --> 01:14:55,360
well, who do you rather hire?

309
01:14:55,360 --> 01:15:00,360
I'd rather hire the person who goes and makes this extra effort to impress me with a fancy paper.

310
01:15:00,360 --> 01:15:03,360
Now, again, of course, it does not need to be a big effect, right?

