01:15:10,360 --> 01:15:12,360
Is that a good investment of your time?

313
01:15:12,360 --> 01:15:15,360
What does it cost?

314
01:15:15,360 --> 01:15:19,360
One trip to the store, 30 bucks for the paper, so maybe like 50 bucks.

315
01:15:19,360 --> 01:15:26,360
And then if it raises your income by 1%, so that could easily be like $500.

