01:49:47,680 --> 01:49:53,760
If you do it for a four-year program, your odds of finishing a four-year program in five years of full-time,

212
01:49:53,760 --> 01:49:55,480
that goes to 55.

213
01:49:55,480 --> 01:49:57,440
Six years goes to 60,

