01:59:27,920 --> 01:59:30,320
When you first, the first job you get,

408
01:59:30,320 --> 01:59:34,640
you'll basically earn a very typical high school dropout's wage.

409
01:59:34,640 --> 01:59:37,400
But over time, 10 years later,

410
01:59:37,400 --> 01:59:40,160
you will be doing better than other high school dropouts on average.

411
01:59:40,160 --> 01:59:45,480
The market will gradually detect your superior ability and then go and reward it for you.

412
01:59:45,480 --> 01:59:48,920
And the penalty for your poor education gradually goes away.

413
01:59:48,920 --> 01:59:51,160
So, at least gradually diminishes anyway.

414
01:59:51,160 --> 01:59:53,880
All right. So, there's this literature here.

415
01:59:53,880 --> 01:59:56,120
And what did it find? Oh, yeah, I'm going to.

416
01:59:56,120 --> 01:60:08,680
General Results, it finds that if you are someone who is...


