01:60:14,600 --> 01:60:16,880
then eventually you do get the market does reward you,

7
01:60:16,880 --> 01:60:19,080
but it takes years and years.

8
01:60:19,080 --> 01:60:20,760
Whereas if you would just do it the normal way,

9
01:60:20,760 --> 01:60:25,160
then you get, then this is a shortcut to getting other rewards.

